OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey stars join Ruth
OL,4,AJones for 60th birthday party at social
OL,5,Aclub
OL,6,
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey's Ruth Jones has
OL,8,Fcelebrated her 60th birthday at a
OL,9,Fsocial club with co-stars including
OL,10,FJames Corden and Rob Brydon.
OL,12,FThe party took place at the Porthcawl
OL,13,Fand Kenfig Hill RAFA (Royal Air Force
OL,14,FAssociation) Club on Saturday where her
OL,15,Fparents were members for several years.
OL,17,FCorden, who co-wrote the series and
OL,18,Fplayed Smithy - the love interest of
OL,19,FJones' Nessa - helped behind the bar
OL,20,Fpouring beers, while Jones reconnected
OL,21,Fwith Brydon to sing country classic
OL,22,FIslands in the Stream on stage.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
