OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey stars join Ruth
OL,4,AJones for 60th birthday party at social
OL,5,Aclub
OL,6,
OL,7,FSarah Prescott, the club's steward,
OL,8,Fdescribed the evening as "overwhelming
OL,9,Fand unbelievable", thanking Jones for
OL,10,Fchoosing the club to host the event.
